msgctxt "seo_title"
msgid "Donate Now"
msgstr "Wspomóż teraz"

msgctxt "search_description"
msgid ""
"We are proudly non-profit, non-corporate and non-compromised. Thousands of people like you help us stand up for a healthy internet for all. We rely on donations to carry out our mission to keep the "
"Web open and free. Will you give today?"
msgstr ""
"Mozilla jest non-profit, niekorporacyjna i niezłomna. Tysiące osób takich jak Ty pomaga nam bronić zdrowego Internetu dla wszystkich. Datki umożliwiają nam wypełniać misję ochrony otwartej i wolnej "
"sieci. Wspomożesz nas dzisiaj?"

msgctxt "title"
msgid "A Better Tech Future Starts With You"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "hero_title"
msgid "A Better Tech Future Starts With You"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.38be4c42-e634-4c9a-9605-b804c000fc28.left_column.2b912452-f231-4b95-929d-cd9769b47ba1.image.alt_text"
msgid "Media (8)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.38be4c42-e634-4c9a-9605-b804c000fc28.right_column.ee29a5d2-6aee-4a78-88e5-f5a8ebefea10.fru_element_embed_code"
msgid "&lt;a href=\"#XFJLGDNG\" style=\"display: none\"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;"
msgstr "&lt;a href=\"#XFJLGDNG\" style=\"display: none\"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;"

msgctxt "body.472a1962-3cab-4f03-8e39-b1451301ca72"
msgid "The future isn't something we wait for. It's something we build."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.472a1962-3cab-4f03-8e39-b1451301ca72"
msgid "We back the people building it. Fellows creating tech alternatives. Communities owning their own data. Creators proving there's another way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.472a1962-3cab-4f03-8e39-b1451301ca72"
msgid "None of it happens without you. Give today, and help build the tech future we all deserve."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "body.472a1962-3cab-4f03-8e39-b1451301ca72"
msgid "<b>Other ways to give:</b> <a id=\"a1\"><b>Check, Bank Transfer, Stocks</b></a>"
msgstr "<b>Inne sposoby wsparcia:</b> <a id=\"a1\"><b>czek, przelew bankowy, akcje</b></a>"

msgctxt "body.472a1962-3cab-4f03-8e39-b1451301ca72"
msgid "<b>Question about donating?</b> Visit our <a id=\"a1\">FAQ</a> for answers to most common questions."
msgstr "<b>Masz pytania?</b> Zobacz <a id=\"a1\">odpowiedzi na najczęstsze z nich</a>."

msgctxt "body.472a1962-3cab-4f03-8e39-b1451301ca72"
msgid "<b>Need to reach us about your donation?</b> <a id=\"a1\">Contact us</a>."
msgstr "<b>Potrzebujesz porozmawiać z nami w sprawie datku?</b> <a id=\"a1\">Skontaktuj się z nami</a>."

msgctxt "body.472a1962-3cab-4f03-8e39-b1451301ca72"
msgid ""
"Contributions go to the <a id=\"a1\">Mozilla Foundation</a>, a 501(c)(3) organization based in San Francisco, California, to be used in its discretion for its charitable purposes. They are tax-"
"deductible in the U.S. to the fullest extent permitted by law."
msgstr ""
"Datki są przekazywane <a id=\"a1\">Mozilla Foundation</a>, organizacji non-profit z siedzibą w San Francisco, Kalifornia, do użytku według jej uznania w jej celach charytatywnych. Datki można "
"odliczać od podatku w Stanach Zjednoczonych w najszerszym zakresie dozwolonym przez prawo."
